stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Received: Intake Registration
    Received --> Assessed: Initial Evaluation

    state check_suitability <<choice>>
    Assessed --> check_suitability: Evaluate Storage Needs

    check_suitability --> Cleaning: [Suitable for conventional dry storage]
    check_suitability --> SpecialistHandling: [Requires recalcitrant or cryo protocol]

    SpecialistHandling --> Stored: Cryopreservation or In-Vitro Setup
    SpecialistHandling --> Retired: Handling Failure

    Cleaning --> Drying: Seed Debris Removed

    state check_moisture <<choice>>
    Drying --> check_moisture: Moisture Content Test
    check_moisture --> Drying: [Moisture above threshold] Re-dry
    check_moisture --> ViabilityTesting: [Moisture optimal] Prepare Baseline Sample

    state check_initial_viability <<choice>>
    ViabilityTesting --> check_initial_viability: Evaluate Baseline Germination

    check_initial_viability --> Stored: [Acceptable germination] Vault Deposit
    check_initial_viability --> RecollectionRequested: [Substandard germination] Low Baseline Viability

    state Stored {
        [*] --> VaultPreservation
        VaultPreservation --> SampleExtracted: Periodic Monitoring Schedule
        SampleExtracted --> VaultPreservation: Retain Inventory Balance
    }

    Stored --> ViabilityTesting: Dispatch Test Sample

    state check_periodic_viability <<choice>>
    ViabilityTesting --> check_periodic_viability: Evaluate Monitoring Germination

    check_periodic_viability --> Stored: [Viability intact] Return Log
    check_periodic_viability --> RecollectionRequested: [Viability critical drop] Flag Inventory Depletion

    RecollectionRequested --> Received: New Field Collection Arrives
    RecollectionRequested --> Retired: Recollection Unfeasible or Decommissioned

    Stored --> Retired: Inventory Exhausted or Damaged
    Retired --> [*]
